{"4387720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Code Critical", "steam_appid": 4387720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your party of nurses &amp; doctors - Heal patients as you uncover an outbreak in this short story, turn-based and adventure game.  Medical encounters are turn-based (paused time) strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diagnose and cure patients in ther turn-based medical encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party members can learn and improve medical skills along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track and heal animals through several areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a variety of vehicles, ride a horse, or take the subway to get around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn what casused the outbreak, and see if you can stop it and who is behind it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime estimated 2-4 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Story, Turn-Based Medical Encounters, Topdown Adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a nurse-in-training, and her unlikely allies as they must all use their unique medical skills to diagnose different ailments.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your party of nurses &amp; doctors - Heal patients as you uncover an outbreak in this short story, turn-based and adventure game.  Medical encounters are turn-based (paused time) strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diagnose and cure patients in ther turn-based medical encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party members can learn and improve medical skills along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track and heal animals through several areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a variety of vehicles, ride a horse, or take the subway 